The '''TX-225 Occupier''' was a line of assault [[tank]]s manufactured by [[Rothana Heavy Engineering]] for the [[Galactic Empire]]. Two versions of the tank were created: the [[TX-225 GAVw "Occupier" combat assault tank|TX-225 GAVw]], and the [[TX-225 GAVr "Occupier" combat assault tank|TX-225 GAVr]]. Both were [[Imperial combat driver|piloted]] by [[Imperial combat assault tank pilot]]s.<ref name="Visual Guide" />

==TX-225 Occupier models==
===TX-225 GAVw "Occupier" combat assault tank===
{{Main|TX-225 GAVw "Occupier" combat assault tank}}
The TX-225 GAVw had a continuous track assembly for propulsion. That model notably saw use on [[Jedha]]. Although efficient, its complex track mechanism required heavy maintenance.<ref name="Visual Guide" />

===TX-225 GAVr "Occupier" combat assault tank===
{{Main|TX-225 GAVr "Occupier" combat assault tank}}
The TX-225 GAVr was fitted with [[repulsorlift]]s that made it [[Hovertank|hover]] slightly above the ground. It was less stable than the tracked model.<ref name="Visual Guide" />

